{"id":"CVE-2011-1521","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2011-05-24T23:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T22:28:41.789Z","description":"The urllib and urllib2 modules in Python 2.x before 2.7.2 and 3.x before 3.2.1 process Location headers that specify redirection to file: URLs, which makes it easier for remote attackers to obtain sensitive information or cause a denial of service (resource consumption) via a crafted URL, as demonstrated by the file:///etc/passwd and file:///dev/zero URLs.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/09/15/5","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20110916 Re: CVE Request -- Django: v1.3.1, v1.2.7 multiple security flaws"},{"url":"http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:096","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_MANDRIVA"],"name":"MDVSA-2011:096"},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-05/msg00005.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"SUSE-SR:2011:009"},{"url":"http://hg.python.org/cpython/rev/b2934d98dac1/","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1592-1","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-1592-1"},{"url":"http://hg.python.org/cpython/rev/96a6c128822b/","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/51040","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"51040"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/50858","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"50858"},{"url":"http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2011//Oct/msg00003.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_APPLE"],"name":"APPLE-SA-2011-10-12-3"},{"url":"http://bugs.python.org/issue11662","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/03/24/5","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],